The only concept-file edit of the v4.33.0 port. deriving Fintype on an
enum (all constructors nullary) fails at mathlib db584cd6 with Lean
4.33.0 (the handler's enum shortcut emits a rewrite the stricter tactic
check rejects; reproduced against bare mathlib). The general route,
instance : Fintype Sym8 := derive_fintype% _, generates the same instance;
it needs Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Sum imported. What is declared is unchanged.
Discussed with Jan 2026-09-14.
---
 lax/CAMPAIGN.md                                       | 3 ++-
 lax/regular-combinators/concepts/Lax709149/Types.lean | 5 ++++-
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/lax/CAMPAIGN.md b/lax/CAMPAIGN.md
index 9021aec..dec0ccf 100644
--- a/lax/CAMPAIGN.md
+++ b/lax/CAMPAIGN.md
@@ -133,7 +133,8 @@ longer bridges `id` and `fun x => x` without `Function.id_def`.
   residue `() = PUnit.unit` closes by `exact fun _ => rfl`, not
   `Subsingleton.elim`), `ITransBuild.lean:187` `Function.id_def` (iii).
 - S5 (`regular-combinators`; every v4.30 workaround still needed). **The
-  one concept-file change of the port, awaiting Jan**:
+  one concept-file change of the port** (discussed with Jan 2026-09-14: no
+  concept dialect is enforced yet, and the declared content is unchanged):
   `concepts/Lax709149/Types.lean:48` `Sym8` (eight nullary constructors)
   `deriving DecidableEq, Fintype` fails (ix); proposed `deriving
   DecidableEq` + `instance : Fintype Sym8 := derive_fintype% _` with
diff --git a/lax/regular-combinators/concepts/Lax709149/Types.lean b/lax/regular-combinators/concepts/Lax709149/Types.lean
index ecb43cf..8608f09 100644
--- a/lax/regular-combinators/concepts/Lax709149/Types.lean
+++ b/lax/regular-combinators/concepts/Lax709149/Types.lean
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 import Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Basic
+import Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Sum
 import Mathlib.Tactic.DeriveFintype
 
 /-!
@@ -45,7 +46,9 @@ def Ty.Elt : Ty → Type
 /-- The alphabet with eight letters `(`, `)`, `[`, `]`, `,`, `1`, `L`, `R`. -/
 inductive Sym8 : Type
   | lpar | rpar | lbrack | rbrack | comma | one | left | right
-  deriving DecidableEq, Fintype
+  deriving DecidableEq
+
+instance : Fintype Sym8 := derive_fintype% _
 
 /-- The entries of a list representation, separated by commas. -/
 def joinSep : List (List Sym8) → List Sym8
